Upcoming Bills
==============

Hi <%= @user.name.presence || @user.email.split('@').first %>, you have <%= @items.size %> upcoming <%= 'bill'.pluralize(@items.size) %>:

<% @items.each do |item| %>
<% days_until = (item[:due_date] - Date.current).to_i %>
